msgid "这会在提交信息末尾自动添加一行 `Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>`，表明你确认该贡献的来源和授权。"
msgstr "This will automatically add a line `Signed-off-by: Your Name <your.email@example.com>` at the end of the commit message, indicating that you confirm the source and authorization of the contribution."

