msgid "Triton-Ascend 定期召开社区技术会议，作为项目治理的核心决策机制。技术方向、重大提案评审和版本发布等重大事项在技术会议中讨论和决定，由全体 `Maintainer` 投票。会议对所有社区成员开放，任何人均可参与讨论，但决策和投票仅由 `Maintainer` 进行。"
msgstr "Triton-Ascend regularly holds community technical meetings as the core decision-making mechanism for project governance. Major matters such as technical direction, major proposal reviews, and version releases are discussed and decided during the technical meetings, with voting conducted by all `Maintainer`s. The meetings are open to all community members, and anyone can participate in discussions, but decisions and voting are carried out only by `Maintainer`s."

